	(text
		"DESIGN NOTES\nBQ24074: power path. OUT (VSYS) = 4.4 V on external power, = VBAT on battery.\nCharging is blocked outside 0-45 C by the pack NTC on TS (parked-in-sun safety).\nVSYS feeds the modem directly (SIM7080G VBAT 2.7-4.8 V, 0.5 A peaks) via U6 load switch,\nwhich lets firmware hard-reset a hung modem. U5 3.3 V LDO is always on (deep sleep rail).\nU7 switches GNSS VCC; V_BCKP stays on +3V3 so ephemeris is kept (hot start < 2 s)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d8171d3b-ae32-5223-9508-19a0c52c295d")
	)
	(text
		"PART NOTES (VERIFY = check against vendor datasheet before release)\nU3: EN2=1/EN1=0 -> ILIM resistor mode; CE low = charge enabled; TMR open = default safety timers (VERIFY)\nR9: IIN_MAX = 1550/R = 1.03 A  VERIFY K_ILIM\nR10: ICHG = 890/R = 500 mA  VERIFY K_ISET\nR11: termination ~10 % ICHG VERIFY\nR13: fit only when the pack has no NTC\nR16: VBAT/2 -> ADC1_CH1, 2.1 uA\nU4: Temperature via I2C (host writes IMU temp); TSW/TSENSE unused VERIFY\nU6: QOD via R to VOUT = quick output discharge"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 219.71 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5c92ce0a-114b-5dec-bed2-e4f364cc1b56")
	)
